## The EULA tick (src/common/terms.rs): the box on the installer's last page before Install

# The words beside the box, which must be ticked before Install. Never ticked in advance. The link opens the text; keep [EULA](eula) as it is.
terms-accept = I agree to the [EULA](eula)

# In the foot, while the box is not ticked, saying why the button beside it is off.
terms-needed = Tick the box to go on
